### Caching Strategy
- Use IMemoryCache for in-process caching
- Implement distributed caching with Redis
- Set appropriate cache expiration times
- Use cache-aside pattern
- Invalidate cache on data changes

### Security Implementation
- Use [Authorize] attribute on controllers/actions
- Implement role-based authorization
- Validate JWT tokens properly
- Use CORS appropriately
- Implement API key authentication where needed

### Performance Optimization
- Use async/await throughout the stack
- Implement database query optimization
- Use projection to select only needed fields
- Implement response compression
- Monitor with Application Insights

### Testing Guidelines
- Unit test all service methods
- Integration test all API endpoints
- Use InMemory database for testing
- Mock external dependencies
- Test error scenarios
- Measure code coverage

Remember: The service layer should contain all business logic. Controllers should only handle HTTP concerns.